%% Directions nested: TD, a subgraph in LR, a subgraph in TD inside it; a label and a back edge inside
%% expect: nodes=6 edges=6 subgraphs=2
flowchart TD
    Input --> Pipeline
    subgraph Pipeline
        direction LR
        Load --> Clean
        Clean -->|rows| Stats
        subgraph Stats[Statistics]
            direction TD
            Mean --> Var[Variance]
            Var -.->|retry| Mean
        end
    end
    Pipeline --> Report
